# Radiant Cut Diamond Necklace: The $867 to $32,929 Truth

A radiant cut diamond necklace is one of the most versatile pieces in fine jewelry. The rectangular crushed-ice facet pattern that makes radiant cut diamonds spectacular in rings works just as well as a pendant or in a full eternity necklace — because the shape catches light from every angle, not just when a hand is moving.

There are three ways to buy one. A pre-made solitaire pendant is the simplest route, but certified market inventory shows only a few options.

A custom pendant through [Blue Nile's design-your-own diamond pendant builder](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) lets you pair a specific loose radiant stone with a setting you choose — full control over carat, color, and clarity. The third option is the [36.75ct lab radiant eternity necklace at $32,929](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — a full collar of 102 radiant-cut lab diamonds, the statement piece of the three.

This guide covers all three. Every stone price comes from certified market inventory as of {{month_year}}.

**TL;DR:**
- → **Lab pendant entry:** [1ct E-VVS1 IGI stone at $867](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29417414?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) via the [design-your-own tool](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- → **Natural pendant entry:** [1ct G-VS2 GIA stone at $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) via the [design-your-own tool](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- → **[The Solitaire Sweet Spot](#the-solitaire-sweet-spot):** 1.5ct — big enough to be unmistakable on the neckline, light enough for daily wear
- → **Pre-made pendants:** 1ct partial-bezel solitaire in [yellow gold](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/diamond-radiant-cut-partial-bezel-solitiare-pendant-in-14k-yellow-gold-1-ct-tw-item-257105?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) and [rose gold](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/diamond-radiant-cut-partial-bezel-solitiare-pendant-in-14k-rose-gold-1-ct-tw-item-257106?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — check availability before ordering
- → **[The Eternity Tier](#the-eternity-tier):** [36.75ct lab radiant eternity necklace at $32,929](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — 102 radiant-cut lab diamonds, 18K yellow gold, 17" chain
- → See the full radiant cut shape guide in the [radiant cut engagement rings pillar](/radiant-cut-engagement-rings)

