## Pre-Made Radiant Cut Diamond Necklaces

Pre-made radiant cut diamond necklaces in certified inventory are limited. There are two solitaire pendant options and one eternity necklace. The solitaire pendants are natural diamond; the eternity necklace is lab-grown — all three sold through Blue Nile.

The two solitaire pendants — in 14K yellow gold and 14K rose gold — feature a 1ct total weight natural radiant diamond in a partial-bezel setting. The bezel wraps the stone at the sides while leaving the table and pavilion exposed, which balances protection with light exposure. Both pendants are the same stone, the same setting, and the same carat weight — the only difference is metal.

The [lab radiant eternity necklace at $32,929](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is a different category entirely — 102 individually prong-set radiant diamonds in 18K yellow gold, with F-G average color and VS1-VS2 average clarity across the full 17-inch chain. It is the [Eternity Tier](#the-eternity-tier) in pre-made radiant jewelry.

| Product | Metal | Stone | Price | What this means |
|---------|-------|-------|-------|-----------------|
| [Radiant Pendant Yellow Gold (item 257105)](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/diamond-radiant-cut-partial-bezel-solitiare-pendant-in-14k-yellow-gold-1-ct-tw-item-257105?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | 14K Yellow Gold | 1ct TW natural radiant | Check availability | Partial-bezel solitaire. The warm gold metal complements the rectangular shape. Best for buyers who want a ready-to-wear radiant pendant without configuring a custom stone. |
| [Radiant Pendant Rose Gold (item 257106)](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/diamond-radiant-cut-partial-bezel-solitiare-pendant-in-14k-rose-gold-1-ct-tw-item-257106?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | 14K Rose Gold | 1ct TW natural radiant | Check availability | Same pendant, rose gold metal. Rose gold adds warmth that complements G-range color in the radiant. A softer, more romantic look than the yellow gold version. |
| [Lab Radiant Eternity Necklace (item 282745)](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | 18K Yellow Gold | 36.75ct TW lab radiant | [$32,929](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | 102 prong-set lab radiant diamonds, F-G color, VS1-VS2 clarity, 17" chain, 18K yellow gold. The full [Eternity Tier](#the-eternity-tier) — a complete collar of radiant light. |

**Verdict:** If you want a ready-made radiant pendant, check the yellow or rose gold solitaire options — they are clean and well-designed, but verify current availability before ordering. If you want a 1ct radiant pendant and they are out of stock, the custom route via the [design-your-own tool](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) gives you more control over the specific stone. For the statement collar piece, the [$32,929 lab eternity](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the only pre-made option at this level.

> **Farzana on Pre-Made Pendants:**
>
> The partial-bezel solitaire design on the yellow and rose gold pendants is one of the better pre-made choices you will find in this shape. The bezel rail protects the girdle — radiant cuts have exposed corners — while keeping enough of the stone visible for the crushed-ice sparkle to come through. If they are available when you are ready to buy, they are worth it.
>
> The design-your-own route is still better if you care which specific stone goes into your necklace. A pre-made pendant uses a stone chosen for the setting — you do not know the exact grading details. With a custom pendant, you select the stone ID and verify the certificate yourself.

