| [1ct G-VS2 Radiant](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | GIA | [$2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | + [setting](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | **Natural entry.** G-VS2 GIA at 1ct. Clean stone for daily wear. The lowest natural radiant pendant price with a GIA certificate. |
| [1ct F-VS2 Radiant](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28954628?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | GIA | [$2,597](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28954628?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | + [setting](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | Better color at 1ct. F at VS2 is visually identical to D in a pendant worn at neckline distance. [$279](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28954628?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) more than the entry for one color grade up. |
