| [1.5ct E-VVS1 Radiant Lab](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/24979338?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | IGI | [$1,600](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/24979338?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | + [setting](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-jewelry/diamond-necklaces/design-your-own-diamond-pendant?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | E-VVS1 at 1.5ct lab. One color grade higher than the F-VVS1 for [$90](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/24979338?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) more. The difference between E and F at 1.5ct pendant-length is not detectable without a direct comparison. |
