> **Farzana's Final Word:**
>
> The radiant cut works exceptionally well as a pendant because the shape catches light differently at every angle of movement — the crushed-ice facets scatter light in multiple directions at once, which means the pendant sparkles when you walk, not just when you stop. That movement sparkle is what separates radiant from other rectangular shapes in a necklace.
>
> For daily wear, the [1.5ct lab at $1,510](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29569681?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the strongest buy in this guide. For a natural statement pendant, the [1.5ct E-VS1 GIA at $7,844](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28090460?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is the sweet spot. And for the full collar experience, the [$32,929 lab eternity](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is genuinely remarkable — 102 radiant diamonds, 18K yellow gold, at a price that would not exist in natural.

## Expert Summary

A radiant cut diamond necklace comes in three forms in current certified market inventory: a pre-made solitaire pendant, a custom design-your-own pendant using a specific loose radiant stone, and the [36.75ct lab radiant eternity necklace at $32,929](https://www.bluenile.com/jewelry/necklaces/lab-grown-radiant-diamond-eternity-necklace-in-18k-yellow-gold-36-1-2-ct-tw-item-282745?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational).

The key concept at this size and style is [The Solitaire Sweet Spot](#the-solitaire-sweet-spot) — the 1.5ct mark where a radiant pendant becomes clearly visible on the neckline without crossing into territory that is too heavy for all-day wear. In lab, that comes at [$1,510](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29569681?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) for the stone; in natural, [$7,844](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28090460?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) — five times the price for the same face-up size. [The Eternity Tier](#the-eternity-tier) is a completely different category: a full collar of radiant diamonds at a price only achievable in lab.

For the full radiant cut shape guide including how the facet pattern behaves in different settings, see the [radiant cut engagement rings pillar](/radiant-cut-engagement-rings). All stone prices are sourced from certified market inventory as of {{month_year}}. Verify current pricing and availability before purchase.

